Package: markdown-viewer
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Lumark Team <maintainers@lumark.local>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.12.0) | libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.24.0), libwebkitgtk-6.0-4 (>= 2.40.0) | libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 (>= 2.40.0)
Description: Lumark - Fast, cross-platform Markdown reader desktop application
 A local-first, standalone desktop Markdown reader built with Wails and Go.
 Features CommonMark and GitHub Flavored Markdown rendering, offline KaTeX math,
 Mermaid diagrams, bidirectional RTL/LTR layout, and secure local asset isolation.
Homepage: https://github.com/personal/lumark
